    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d79">

                <pb facs="0133" n="867" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg867"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Willis to Mr. Olney.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Extract.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Honolulu</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-01-06"><hi rendition="#italic">January 6, 1896</hi></date>.
                        (Received Jan. 20.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 145.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: The principal, if not the only, event of
                    importance during the past two months was the release on parole of the remaining
                    political prisoners, which occurred on the 1st instant.</p>
                <p>* * * * * * *</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Albert S. Willis.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
